# Line-ending policy.
#
# Several files in this repository have their exact bytes attested by a
# checksum: the third-party reproduction artifact under data/third_party/ is
# SHA-256 pinned by the test suite, and each papers/*/SHA256SUMS attests the
# manuscript sources and reproducibility scripts beside it. Git's default
# behaviour on Windows is to translate LF to CRLF on checkout, which changes
# those bytes and breaks every one of those checks.
#
# Every tracked file is stored with LF, so this file is a no-op for content and
# exists purely to keep checkouts byte-identical across platforms.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Byte-exact records: perform no translation at all.
data/third_party/** -text
papers/**/SHA256SUMS -text
